## PR Title
add null check to avoid null pointer exception

## PR Description
"This PR is to fix #35."

The change adds a null-check guard so that the slave driver does not dereference a null sequence-item handle when it is reset partway through a transaction; the issue had been reported as a NULL pointer dereference in `uvm_transaction::get_event_pool` triggered by `tue_sequence_item_base::get_event` / `ended` being called from `tvip_axi_slave_driver`'s start-delay thread after a mid-transaction reset.

